# Mashes Start through the logos, title and menus to reach gameplay, then
# walks Zeke around level 1. The trailing B was meant to be the water pistol and
# is not — **Y is the fire button**, and the ammo counter never moves off 150 in
# this movie or in level1-rescue.zmv. Left as it is on purpose: this is the
# oldest regression baseline in the project and every count recorded against it
# was measured from these exact bytes. `movies/level1-2p.zmv` is the one that
# shoots.
# Regenerate with tools/make_movie.sh if the timing ever needs retuning.
